# Crew-managed project copies of skills from a private repository. This
# repository is public, so all entries in the Crew target directories are
# ignored. To track a skill that this repository owns, add a negation rule,
# for example !/.claude/skills/<name>/.
/.agents/skills/*
/.claude/skills/*
